<section class="page-hero shell links-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-copy" data-reveal>
    <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> FRIENDS / NEIGHBORS</p>
    <h1>友链</h1>
    <p>互联网上的一些小径。它们通向不同的人、不同的兴趣，以及值得反复阅读的角落。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="links-doodle" data-reveal aria-hidden="true">
    <span>↗</span><span>↘</span><span>→</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section shell links-grid">
  <% links.forEach((link, index) => { %>
  <a class="link-card" href="<%= safeExternalUrl(link.url) %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-reveal style="--accent: <%= link.color %>">
    <div class="link-card-top">
      <span class="link-avatar">
        <% if (link.avatar_url) { %><img src="<%= safeExternalUrl(link.avatar_url) %>" alt=""><% } else { %><%= link.name.slice(0, 1) %><% } %>
      </span>
      <span class="link-external"><svg><use href="/assets/images/icons.svg#icon-external"></use></svg></span>
    </div>
    <h2><%= link.name %></h2>
    <p><%= link.description %></p>
    <span class="link-domain"><%= link.url.replace(/^https?:\/\//, '').split('/')[0] %></span>
  </a>
  <% }) %>
  <div class="link-card link-card-empty" data-reveal>
    <span class="link-empty-mark">+</span>
    <h2>交换友链</h2>
    <p>如果你也在认真维护自己的站点，欢迎来信交换链接。</p>
    <% if (settings.email) { %><a href="mailto:<%= settings.email %>">发送邮件 <svg><use href="/assets/images/icons.svg#icon-arrow"></use></svg></a><% } %>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="shell links-note" data-reveal>
  <span class="mini-label">A SMALL WEB</span>
  <p>个人网站最好的部分，是它们不需要成为平台。这里只收录我真实访问、并且愿意推荐给朋友的站点。</p>
</section>
